  "final_answer": "I have obtained the answer from Wolfram Alpha. Based on the results displayed in the DOM, here is the complete answer:\n\n## Answer\n\n**The blood relationship fraction between you and your father's mother's sister's son is 1/32 (3.125%).**\n\n### Detailed Results from Wolfram Alpha:\n\n| Attribute | Value |\n|-----------|-------|\n| **Relationship** | 隔代1表亲 (First cousin once removed) |\n| **Generations apart** | 1 |\n| **Generations from common ancestor** | 3 |\n| **Blood relationship fraction** | **1/32 = 3.125%** |\n\n### Explanation:\n- Your father's mother = your paternal grandmother (PGM)\n- Your father's mother's sister = your paternal grandmother's sister (your grand-aunt)\n- Your father's mother's sister's son = your father's cousin (they share the same grandparents)\n- Since this person is one generation above your first cousins, you are **first cousins once removed** with them\n- The blood relationship fraction (coefficient of relationship) is calculated as (1/2)^5 = **1/32 = 3.125%**",
